design:
Keep Pathfinder fixture intentionally compact but real. Do not include Paizo reserved setting names, trade dress, compatibility branding, or large copied text blocks. Use mechanical facts needed by tests and carry source/license metadata so later expansion is straightforward. Existing `SRD_CATALOG` and `lookupSrdRecord` remain available.

Initial test sketch:
```ts
expect(validateRulesPack(DND5E_SRD_RULES_PACK).meta.systemId).toBe('dnd5e-srd');
expect(validateRulesPack(PATHFINDER2E_REMASTER_RULES_PACK).meta.systemId).toBe('pathfinder2e-remaster');
expect(PATHFINDER2E_REMASTER_RULES_PACK.meta.license.licenseName).toContain('ORC');
```
